  quiet_note: {"ms": "Harga dewasa, kanak-kanak, MyKad dan syarat umur belum disahkan pada 19 Oktober 2026. Semak terus dengan operator; pakej pelancongan pihak ketiga tidak semestinya tiket masuk muzium.", "en": "Adult, child and MyKad prices and age conditions were not verified on 19 October 2026. Confirm with the operator; third-party tour packages are not necessarily museum admission tickets.", "zh": "截至2026年10月19日，未核实成人、儿童、MyKad票价及年龄条件。请向运营方确认；第三方旅游套餐不等同博物馆入场票。"},
  marker_03_label: { ms: "Cara ke sini", en: "How to get here", zh: "如何抵达" },
  eyebrow_03: { ms: "Bukan tersesat. Cuma arahnya sedikit songsang.", en: "Not lost. Just a little upside down.", zh: "不是迷路。只是方向有点颠倒。" },
  h2_03_a: { ms: "Senang sampai ke ", en: "Easy to reach ", zh: "轻松抵达" },
  h2_03_b: { ms: "Lebuh Kimberley.", en: "Lebuh Kimberley.", zh: "金伯利街。" },
  tr_air_title: { ms: "Dari Lapangan Terbang Antarabangsa Pulau Pinang", en: "From Penang International Airport", zh: "从槟城国际机场出发" },
  tr_air_p: { ms: "Dari Lapangan Terbang Antarabangsa Pulau Pinang (PEN), cara paling terus ialah mengambil teksi atau Grab e-hailing terus ke Lebuh Kimberley, George Town. Perjalanan mengambil masa lebih kurang 30–45 minit, bergantung pada trafik bandar.", en: "From Penang International Airport (PEN), a taxi or Grab e-hailing ride directly to Lebuh Kimberley is the most direct option. Drive time is roughly 30–45 minutes, depending on city traffic.", zh: "从槟城国际机场（PEN, Penang International Airport）前往，计程车或 Grab 网约车最直接到乔治市金伯利街。车程约 30–45 分钟，视市区交通状况而定。" },
  tr_bus_title: { ms: "Bas Rapid Penang", en: "Rapid Penang buses", zh: "快捷通巴士 Rapid Penang" },
  tr_bus_p: { ms: "Naik bas Rapid Penang menuju ke George Town atau Komtar. Setelah turun, sambung dengan berjalan kaki jarak dekat atau Grab jarak pendek. Semak aplikasi rasmi Rapid Penang atau papan bas pada hari lawatan untuk jadual terkini.", en: "Take Rapid Penang heading toward George Town or Komtar. After alighting, continue on foot a short distance or catch a quick Grab ride. Check the official Rapid Penang App or bus stop notice on your travel day for the latest schedule.", zh: "乘坐 Rapid Penang 前往乔治市或 Komtar 光大大厦方向的线路，下车后步行一小段或短程 Grab 衔接即可。出行当天请查看 Rapid Penang 官方 App 或站台信息确认班次。" },
  tr_taxi_title: { ms: "Teksi & e-hailing", en: "Taxis & e-hailing", zh: "计程车 & 网约车" },
  tr_taxi_p: { ms: "Inginkan perkhidmatan pintu ke pintu, pilih teksi meter atau Grab. Lokasinya berada di teras warisan Pulau Pinang; sebutkan alamat penuh atau cari terus \"Upside Down Museum Penang\" dan minta pemandu berhenti betul-betul di hadapan rumah kedai biru.", en: "For door-to-door service, choose metered taxis or Grab. The venue sits inside Penang's heritage core; give the full address or search directly for \"Upside Down Museum Penang\" and ask the driver to stop right in front of the blue shophouse.", zh: "想要门到门服务，选打表计程车或 Grab。地点位于槟城世遗核心区；记得报完整地址或直接搜「Upside Down Museum Penang」，让司机停在蓝色店屋正门口。" },
  tr_walk_title: { ms: "Berjalan kaki dari kawasan warisan", en: "Walk from the heritage quarter", zh: "从世遗区步行" },
  tr_walk_p: { ms: "Jika anda sudah berjalan di kawasan mural Armenian Street, Komtar atau seni jalanan sekitar, muzium ini boleh dimasukkan terus ke laluan jalan kaki anda untuk lawatan warisan George Town seharian.", en: "If you are already walking around Armenian Street murals, Komtar or the nearby street art district, the museum can be folded straight into a walking itinerary for a full George Town heritage day.", zh: "如果你本来就在亚美尼亚街壁画区、Komtar 光大大厦或街头艺术周边散步，博物馆完全可以并入步行路线，串联乔治市世遗一日游。" },
  eyebrow_04_map: { ms: "Titik mula yang betul", en: "The right starting point", zh: "正确的起点" },
  h2_04_map_a: { ms: "Cari rumah kedai biru. ", en: "Find the blue shophouse. ", zh: "找到蓝色店屋。" },
  h2_04_map_b: { ms: "Kemudian songsangkan seluruh hari anda.", en: "Then flip your whole day upside down.", zh: "然后颠倒你的一整天。" },
  map_button: { ms: "Arah di Google Maps", en: "Directions on Google Maps", zh: "在 Google Maps 查看路线" },
  parking_label: { ms: "Letak kereta:", en: "Parking:", zh: "停车：" },
  parking_p: { ms: "Tempat letak kereta di tepi jalan di teras warisan George Town sangat terhad. Sebaiknya gunakan tempat letak kereta awam atau bertingkat berhampiran Komtar, kemudian berjalan kaki atau e-hailing jarak pendek — jimat masa dan lebih tenang.", en: "On-street parking in George Town's heritage core is very scarce. Use public or multi-storey carparks near Komtar, then walk or take a short e-hailing ride — saves time and hassle.", zh: "乔治市世遗核心区路边车位非常紧张。建议使用 Komtar 光大大厦周边公共停车场或多层停车场，再步行或短程电召车到达，省时省心。" },
  iframe_title: { ms: "Peta lokasi Muzium Terbalik George Town, Pulau Pinang", en: "Upside Down Museum location map, George Town Penang", zh: "槟城乔治市颠倒博物馆位置地图" },
  marker_04_label: { ms: "Selepas bergambar", en: "After your visit", zh: "拍完照之后" },
  eyebrow_04a: { ms: "Jalan-jalan yang patut disinggah sepanjang jalan", en: "Worthwhile stops along the way", zh: "值得顺道看看的街道" },
  h2_04a_a: { ms: "Satu jam di dalam muzium. ", en: "One hour inside. ", zh: "一小时在馆内。" },
  h2_04a_b: { ms: "Seharian menjelajah sekitar.", en: "A whole day nearby.", zh: "一整天逛周边。" },
  nearby_food_topline: { ms: "MAKAN", en: "EAT", zh: "美 食" },
  nearby_food_title: { ms: "Selepas bergambar, rasai rasa Pulau Pinang yang sebenar.", en: "After the photos, taste real Penang.", zh: "拍完照，品尝正宗槟城味道。" },
  nearby_food_p: { ms: "Lebuh Kimberley sendiri merupakan lokasi pasar malam makanan yang terkenal di Pulau Pinang. Keluar dari muzium, pusing sedikit sahaja — gerai yang paling ramai orang biasanya yang paling sedap.", en: "Lebuh Kimberley itself is a famous Penang night market food street. Step out of the museum, turn a corner — the most crowded stalls are almost always the most delicious.", zh: "金伯利街本身就是槟城著名的夜市场美食街。从博物馆出来，转个弯就能尝到最地道的槟城街头风味，挑人多的摊位准没错。" },
  food_1: { ms: "Char Kway Teow", en: "Char Kway Teow", zh: "炒粿条 Char Kway Teow" },
  food_2: { ms: "Laksa Assam", en: "Assam Laksa", zh: "亚参叻沙 Assam Laksa" },
  food_3: { ms: "Nasi Kandar", en: "Nasi Kandar", zh: "扁担饭 Nasi Kandar" },
  food_4: { ms: "Pasar malam Lebuh Kimberley", en: "Lebuh Kimberley night market stalls", zh: "金伯利街夜市大排档" },
  nearby_sights_topline: { ms: "JELAJAH", en: "SEE", zh: "景 点" },
  nearby_sights_title: { ms: "Terus jelajahi bandar warisan — tak perlu tergesa-gesa balik hotel.", en: "Continue the heritage walk — no rush back to the hotel.", zh: "接着逛世遗古城，不急着回酒店。" },
  nearby_sights_p: { ms: "Muzium ini terletak betul-betul di teras warisan Pulau Pinang. Berjalan kaki atau e-hailing jarak pendek sahaja untuk menyambung ke mercu tanda budaya utama George Town.", en: "The museum sits right inside Penang's heritage core. A short walk or ride connects you to George Town's most iconic cultural landmarks.", zh: "博物馆所在地恰好位于槟城世遗核心区，步行或短程车即可串联乔治市经典文化地标。" },
  sights_1: { ms: "Mural Armenian Street · Seni Jalanan George Town", en: "Armenian Street murals · George Town street art", zh: "亚美尼亚街壁画 · 乔治市街头艺术" },
  sights_2: { ms: "Khoo Kongsi", en: "Khoo Kongsi clan house", zh: "邱公司 Khoo Kongsi 宗祠" },
  sights_3: { ms: "Menara Tinjau Komtar", en: "Komtar Tower observation deck", zh: "Komtar 光大大厦观景台" },
  sights_4: { ms: "Rumah Biru Cheong Fatt Tze", en: "Cheong Fatt Tze Blue Mansion", zh: "张弼士故居 Cheong Fatt Tze 蓝屋" },
  nearby_photo_alt: { ms: "Pelawat bergambar di dapur gaya Nyonya songsang dalam muzium", en: "Visitors posing in an inverted Nyonya-style kitchen scene", zh: "颠倒博物馆倒置娘惹风格厨房场景内游客摆拍" },
  figcaption_04: { ms: "GAMBAR BAIK SELALU BERMULA DARI SUDUT YANG SALAH.", en: "A GREAT PHOTO ALWAYS STARTS FROM A WRONG ANGLE.", zh: "好照片，往往从一个错误的角度开始。" },
  marker_05_label: { ms: "Soalan lazim", en: "Frequently asked", zh: "常见问题" },
  eyebrow_05: { ms: "Sebelum memutar kamera", en: "Before you flip the camera", zh: "在翻转镜头之前" },
  h2_05_a: { ms: "Jawapan ringkas untuk ", en: "Short answers for ", zh: "给" },
  h2_05_b: { ms: "perjalanan seharian anda.", en: "your whole day itinerary.", zh: "整天行程的简短回答。" },
  faq_group_alt: { ms: "Keluarga pelawat bergambar di ruang songsang Muzium Terbalik Pulau Pinang", en: "Family posing in an inverted room at Upside Down Museum Penang", zh: "家庭游客在槟城颠倒博物馆倒置房间内合影" },
  faq_1_s: { ms: "Berapa lama masa yang disyorkan untuk melawat?", en: "How long should I allow for the visit?", zh: "建议预留多长时间参观？" },
  faq_1_p: { ms: "Sediakan masa lebih kurang 1 jam untuk melawat semua ruang dan bergambar. Jika ingin latar belakang bersih tanpa orang ramai, sebaiknya datang pada hari bekerja atau waktu pagi.", en: "Allow about 1 hour to see all spaces and take photos. For a clean, crowd-free background, come on a weekday or early in the morning.", zh: "建议约 1 小时从容逛完展区并拍照。如果想避开人群、拍出干净的背景，推荐工作日或上午时段前往。" },
  faq_2_s: { ms: "Bolehkah mengambil gambar di dalam?", en: "Is photography allowed inside?", zh: "馆内允许拍照吗？" },
  faq_2_p: {"ms": "Penang Global Tourism menerangkan pengalaman fotografi interaktif dalam ruang terbalik. Ikut peraturan operator tentang fotografi, peralatan dan penggunaan set.", "en": "Penang Global Tourism describes interactive photography in upside-down rooms. Follow the operator’s rules on photography, equipment and use of the sets.", "zh": "槟城旅游局介绍此处为颠倒房间中的互动摄影体验。请遵守运营方对拍照、器材及布景使用的规定。"},
  faq_3_s: {"ms": "Berapakah harga tiket dan perlu tempahan?", "en": "What are ticket prices and do I need a booking?", "zh": "票价多少，需要预约吗？"},
  faq_3_p: {"ms": "Harga semasa, diskaun MyKad, had umur dan syarat tempahan belum disahkan dalam panduan ini. Hubungi operator untuk kadar, dokumen, ketersediaan dan polisi pada tarikh lawatan.", "en": "This guide has not verified current prices, MyKad discounts, age limits or booking conditions. Contact the operator for rates, required documents, availability and policies on your visit date.", "zh": "本指南未核实当前票价、MyKad优惠、年龄限制或预约条件。请联系运营方确认到访日期的价格、所需证件、余票与政策。"},
  faq_4_s: { ms: "Sesuai untuk anak kecil?", en: "Suitable for young children?", zh: "适合带小朋友去吗？" },
  faq_4_p: {"ms": "Untuk lawatan bersama kanak-kanak, tanya operator tentang kesesuaian set, akses, had umur dan peraturan. Temani anak semasa bergerak atau bergambar; panduan ini tidak menjamin kesesuaian untuk semua umur.", "en": "For visits with children, ask the operator about set suitability, access, age limits and rules. Accompany children while moving or posing; this guide does not guarantee suitability for every age.", "zh": "带儿童到访前，请向运营方询问布景适用性、通行条件、年龄限制与规则。走动和拍照时请陪同；本指南不保证适合所有年龄。"},
  faq_5_s: { ms: "Bagaimana jika hujan di George Town?", en: "What if it rains in George Town?", zh: "遇到乔治市下雨怎么办？" },
  faq_5_p: { ms: "Muzium ini adalah tempat tertutup — sangat sesuai walaupun hujan atau cuaca panas tengah hari. Susun laluan berjalan kaki dari tempat turun teksi/e-hailing ke pintu masuk untuk mengurangkan masa di luar rumah.", en: "The museum is indoors — perfect even when it rains or during hot midday weather. Plan a short walking route from your drop-off point to the entrance to minimize time in the open.", zh: "博物馆本身就是室内景点，下雨或午后炎热天气里都非常合适。建议提前规划好从下车点到馆门口的步行路线，减少在户外日晒雨淋的时间。" },
  closing_eyebrow: { ms: "Petunjuk kecil terakhir", en: "One last small tip", zh: "最后一个小提示" },
  h2_closing_a: { ms: "Rancang selama satu jam. ", en: "Plan for one hour. ", zh: "计划一小时。" },
  h2_closing_b: { ms: "Bawa balik keseluruhan album gambar songsang.", en: "Go home with a whole album upside down.", zh: "带回一整辑颠倒的照片。" },
  closing_button: { ms: "Mulakan perjalanan", en: "Start your visit", zh: "开启旅程" },
  footer_nonprofit: { ms: "Laman web ini adalah projek panduan maklumat pelawat bebas dan bukan untung. Tiada pertalian dengan mana-mana agensi kerajaan atau organisasi rasmi.", en: "This website is an independent, non-profit visitor information guide project. It is not affiliated with any government agency or official organization.", zh: "本网站为一个独立的非营利游客信息指南项目，与任何政府机构或官方组织均无隶属关系。" },
  footer_sources_prefix: {"ms": "Rujukan perancangan: ", "en": "Planning references: ", "zh": "行程参考："},
  footer_sources_sep1: { ms: "、", en: ", ", zh: "、" },
  footer_sources_sep2: { ms: " dan ", en: " and ", zh: "与" },
  footer_sources_suffix: { ms: ". Tidak mengandungi sebarang cadangan komersial.", en: ". No commercial recommendations are included.", zh: "公开资料，不包含任何商业性推荐。" },
  footer_sources_org1: {"ms": "Penang Global Tourism", "en": "Penang Global Tourism", "zh": "Penang Global Tourism"},
  footer_sources_org2: {"ms": "Google Maps", "en": "Google Maps", "zh": "Google Maps"},
  footer_sources_org3: {"ms": "Operator muzium", "en": "Museum operator", "zh": "博物馆运营方"},
  footer_legal_heading: { ms: "Maklumat undang-undang", en: "Legal", zh: "法律信息" },
  footer_legal_privacy: { ms: "Dasar Privasi", en: "Privacy Policy", zh: "隐私政策" },
  footer_legal_terms: { ms: "Terma Perkhidmatan", en: "Terms of Service", zh: "服务条款" },
  footer_legal_cookies: { ms: "Tetapan Cookie", en: "Cookie Settings", zh: "Cookie 设置" },
  footer_copyright: { ms: "© 2026 Upside Down Museum Guide. Hak cipta terpelihara.", en: "© 2026 Upside Down Museum Guide. All rights reserved.", zh: "© 2026 Upside Down Museum Guide。保留所有权利。" },
  footer_image_heading: { ms: "Pernyataan hak cipta gambar", en: "Image copyright notice", zh: "图片产权声明" },
  footer_image_note: {"ms": "Gambar disampaikan sebagai aset laman. Hak cipta kekal milik pemilik masing-masing; tiada lesen baharu didakwa.", "en": "Images are served as site assets. Copyright remains with the respective owners; no new licence is asserted.", "zh": "图片作为网站资源提供，版权归各自所有者；本站不新增授权声明。"},
  footer_to_top: { ms: "Ke atas ↑", en: "Back to top ↑", zh: "回到顶部 ↑" },
  lang_switch_ms: { ms: "MS", en: "MS", zh: "马来" },
  lang_switch_en: { ms: "EN", en: "EN", zh: "英文" },
  lang_switch_zh: { ms: "中", en: "中", zh: "中文" },
  source_snapshot: {"ms": "Disemak 19 Oktober 2026: Google Maps 4.2/5 daripada 5,860 ulasan pihak ketiga. Waktu 09:30–18:30, kemasukan terakhir 17:45 menurut Penang Global Tourism. Semak perubahan dengan operator.", "en": "Checked 19 October 2026: Google Maps 4.2/5 from 5,860 third-party reviews. Hours 09:30–18:30, last admission 17:45 according to Penang Global Tourism. Check changes with the operator.", "zh": "2026年10月19日核对：Google地图4.2/5分、5,860条第三方评价。槟城旅游局列示09:30–18:30开放、17:45最晚入场。请向运营方确认变动。"},
  switcher_aria: { ms: "Penukar bahasa", en: "Language switcher", zh: "语言切换器" }
};

const faqSchemaFor = (lang: "ms" | "en" | "zh") => ({
  "@context":"https://schema.org", "@type":"FAQPage",
  mainEntity: [1,2,3,4,5].map(n => ({"@type":"Question",name:t[`faq_${n}_s` as keyof typeof t][lang],acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:t[`faq_${n}_p` as keyof typeof t][lang]}}))
});

---

<BaseLayout
  titleMs="Muzium Terbalik Penang · Panduan Pelawat George Town"
  titleEn="Upside Down Museum Penang · George Town Travel Guide"
  titleZh="槟城颠倒博物馆 · 乔治市旅游指南"
  descMs="Panduan bebas Muzium Terbalik Penang: 45 Lebuh Kimberley, George Town, waktu 09:30–18:30, kemasukan terakhir 17:45 dan perkara untuk disahkan tentang tiket."
  descEn="Independent Upside Down Museum Penang guide: 45 Lebuh Kimberley, George Town, 09:30–18:30 hours, last admission 17:45 and ticket details to confirm."
  descZh="槟城颠倒博物馆独立指南：乔治市金伯利街45号，09:30–18:30开放、17:45最晚入场，以及购票前须向运营方确认的事项。"
>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(attractionSchema)} />
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" data-i18n="faq_schema" data-ms={JSON.stringify(faqSchemaFor("ms"))} data-en={JSON.stringify(faqSchemaFor("en"))} data-zh={JSON.stringify(faqSchemaFor("zh"))} set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchemaFor("ms"))} />
  <header class="site-header" id="atas">
    <a class="brand" href="#atas" data-i18n="header_brand_aria" data-ms={t.header_aria_brand.ms} data-en={t.header_aria_brand.en} data-zh={t.header_aria_brand.zh} aria-label={t.header_aria_brand.ms}>
      <img data-fallback src="/upside-down-museum-logo.png" data-i18n="logo_alt" data-ms={t.logo_alt.ms} data-en={t.logo_alt.en} data-zh={t.logo_alt.zh} alt={t.logo_alt.ms} width="48" height="48" />
      <span>
        <strong>Upside Down</strong>
        <small data-i18n="brand_small" data-ms={t.brand_small.ms} data-en={t.brand_small.en} data-zh={t.brand_small.zh}>{t.brand_small.ms}</small>
      </span>
    </a>
    <nav data-i18n="nav_aria_label" data-ms={t.nav_aria.ms} data-en={t.nav_aria.en} data-zh={t.nav_aria.zh} aria-label={t.nav_aria.ms}>
      <a href="#pengalaman" data-i18n="nav_pengalaman" data-ms={t.nav_pengalaman.ms} data-en={t.nav_pengalaman.en} data-zh={t.nav_pengalaman.zh}>{t.nav_pengalaman.ms}</a>
      <a href="#rancang" data-i18n="nav_rancang" data-ms={t.nav_rancang.ms} data-en={t.nav_rancang.en} data-zh={t.nav_rancang.zh}>{t.nav_rancang.ms}</a>
      <a href="#sekitar" data-i18n="nav_sekitar" data-ms={t.nav_sekitar.ms} data-en={t.nav_sekitar.en} data-zh={t.nav_sekitar.zh}>{t.nav_sekitar.ms}</a>
      <a href="#soalan" data-i18n="nav_soalan" data-ms={t.nav_soalan.ms} data-en={t.nav_soalan.en} data-zh={t.nav_soalan.zh}>{t.nav_soalan.ms}</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="lang-switcher" data-i18n="switcher_aria_label" data-ms={t.switcher_aria.ms} data-en={t.switcher_aria.en} data-zh={t.switcher_aria.zh} role="group" aria-label={t.switcher_aria.ms}>
      <button data-lang-switch="ms" type="button">{t.lang_switch_ms.ms}</button>
      <button data-lang-switch="en" type="button">{t.lang_switch_en.ms}</button>
      <button data-lang-switch="zh" type="button">{t.lang_switch_zh.ms}</button>
    </div>
    <a class="header-pin" href={mapUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="header_pin_text" data-ms={t.header_pin_text.ms} data-en={t.header_pin_text.en} data-zh={t.header_pin_text.zh}>
      {t.header_pin_text.ms} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="tajuk-hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> <span data-i18n="eyebrow_location" data-ms={t.eyebrow_location.ms} data-en={t.eyebrow_location.en} data-zh={t.eyebrow_location.zh}>{t.eyebrow_location.ms}</span></p>
        <h1 id="tajuk-hero">
          <span data-i18n="hero_title_a" data-ms={t.hero_title_inner_a.ms} data-en={t.hero_title_inner_a.en} data-zh={t.hero_title_inner_a.zh}>{t.hero_title_inner_a.ms}</span><em data-i18n="hero_title_b" data-ms={t.hero_title_inner_b.ms} data-en={t.hero_title_inner_b.en} data-zh={t.hero_title_inner_b.zh}>{t.hero_title_inner_b.ms}</em>.
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-i18n="hero_intro" data-ms={t.hero_intro.ms} data-en={t.hero_intro.en} data-zh={t.hero_intro.zh}>{t.hero_intro.ms}</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-coral" href="#rancang"><span data-i18n="hero_plan" data-ms={t.hero_plan.ms} data-en={t.hero_plan.en} data-zh={t.hero_plan.zh}>{t.hero_plan.ms}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={mapUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span data-i18n="hero_open_map" data-ms={t.hero_open_map.ms} data-en={t.hero_open_map.en} data-zh={t.hero_open_map.zh}>{t.hero_open_map.ms}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="photo-credit" data-i18n="photo_credit" data-ms={t.photo_credit.ms} data-en={t.photo_credit.en} data-zh={t.photo_credit.zh}>{t.photo_credit.ms}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" data-i18n="hero_visual_aria_label" data-ms={t.hero_visual_aria.ms} data-en={t.hero_visual_aria.en} data-zh={t.hero_visual_aria.zh} aria-label={t.hero_visual_aria.ms}>
        <div class="poster-stamp"><span data-i18n="poster_stamp_1" data-ms={t.poster_stamp_1.ms} data-en={t.poster_stamp_1.en} data-zh={t.poster_stamp_1.zh}>{t.poster_stamp_1.ms}</span><br /><span data-i18n="poster_stamp_2" data-ms={t.poster_stamp_2.ms} data-en={t.poster_stamp_2.en} data-zh={t.poster_stamp_2.zh}>{t.poster_stamp_2.ms}</span></div>
        <img class="hero-graphic" data-fallback src="/upside-down-museum-abstract-hero.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        <img class="hero-photo" src="/upside-down-museum-exterior.jpg" data-i18n="hero_exterior_alt" data-ms={t.logo_alt.ms} data-en={t.logo_alt.en} data-zh={t.logo_alt.zh} alt={t.logo_alt.ms} />
        <p class="image-note" data-i18n="image_note" data-ms={t.image_note.ms} data-en={t.image_note.en} data-zh={t.image_note.zh}>{t.image_note.ms}</p>
        <div class="corner-frame" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-facts" data-i18n="facts_aria_label" data-ms={t.facts_aria.ms} data-en={t.facts_aria.en} data-zh={t.facts_aria.zh} aria-label={t.facts_aria.ms}>
        <div><span data-i18n="facts_open_label" data-ms={t.facts_open_label.ms} data-en={t.facts_open_label.en} data-zh={t.facts_open_label.zh}>{t.facts_open_label.ms}</span><strong>09:30–18:30</strong><small data-i18n="facts_open_small" data-ms={t.facts_open_small.ms} data-en={t.facts_open_small.en} data-zh={t.facts_open_small.zh}>{t.facts_open_small.ms}</small></div>
        <div><span data-i18n="facts_price_label" data-ms={t.facts_price_label.ms} data-en={t.facts_price_label.en} data-zh={t.facts_price_label.zh}>{t.facts_price_label.ms}</span><strong>—</strong><small data-i18n="facts_price_small" data-ms={t.facts_price_small.ms} data-en={t.facts_price_small.en} data-zh={t.facts_price_small.zh}>{t.facts_price_small.ms}</small></div>
        <div><span data-i18n="facts_rating_label" data-ms={t.facts_rating_label.ms} data-en={t.facts_rating_label.en} data-zh={t.facts_rating_label.zh}>{t.facts_rating_label.ms}</span><strong>4.2 / 5</strong><small data-i18n="facts_rating_small" data-ms={t.facts_rating_small.ms} data-en={t.facts_rating_small.en} data-zh={t.facts_rating_small.zh}>{t.facts_rating_small.ms}</small></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="poster-break" aria-hidden="true"><span>↘</span><span>↗</span><span>↘</span></div>
    <section class="story-section section-wrap" id="pengalaman" aria-labelledby="tajuk-pengalaman">
      <div class="section-marker">
        <span>01</span><i></i>
        <span data-i18n="marker_01_label" data-ms={t.marker_01_label.ms} data-en={t.marker_01_label.en} data-zh={t.marker_01_label.zh}>{t.marker_01_label.ms}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="story-layout">
        <div class="story-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> <span data-i18n="eyebrow_01" data-ms={t.eyebrow_01.ms} data-en={t.eyebrow_01.en} data-zh={t.eyebrow_01.zh}>{t.eyebrow_01.ms}</span></p>
          <h2 id="tajuk-pengalaman">
            <span data-i18n="h2_01_a" data-ms={t.h2_01_a.ms} data-en={t.h2_01_a.en} data-zh={t.h2_01_a.zh}>{t.h2_01_a.ms}</span><em data-i18n="h2_01_b" data-ms={t.h2_01_b.ms} data-en={t.h2_01_b.en} data-zh={t.h2_01_b.zh}>{t.h2_01_b.ms}</em>
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n="p_01" data-ms={t.p_01.ms} data-en={t.p_01.en} data-zh={t.p_01.zh}>{t.p_01.ms}</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="tilt-photo photo-room">
          <img src="/upside-down-museum-room.jpg" data-i18n="story_room_alt" data-ms={t.story_room_alt.ms} data-en={t.story_room_alt.en} data-zh={t.story_room_alt.zh} alt={t.story_room_alt.ms} loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption data-i18n="figcaption_01" data-ms={t.figcaption_01.ms} data-en={t.figcaption_01.en} data-zh={t.figcaption_01.zh}>{t.figcaption_01.ms}</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="story-notes">
          <article><span class="note-number">A</span><h3 data-i18n="note_a_title" data-ms={t.note_a_title.ms} data-en={t.note_a_title.en} data-zh={t.note_a_title.zh}>{t.note_a_title.ms}</h3><p data-i18n="note_a_p" data-ms={t.note_a_p.ms} data-en={t.note_a_p.en} data-zh={t.note_a_p.zh}>{t.note_a_p.ms}</p></article>
          <article><span class="note-number">B</span><h3 data-i18n="note_b_title" data-ms={t.note_b_title.ms} data-en={t.note_b_title.en} data-zh={t.note_b_title.zh}>{t.note_b_title.ms}</h3><p data-i18n="note_b_p" data-ms={t.note_b_p.ms} data-en={t.note_b_p.en} data-zh={t.note_b_p.zh}>{t.note_b_p.ms}</p></article>
          <article><span class="note-number">C</span><h3 data-i18n="note_c_title" data-ms={t.note_c_title.ms} data-en={t.note_c_title.en} data-zh={t.note_c_title.zh}>{t.note_c_title.ms}</h3><p data-i18n="note_c_p" data-ms={t.note_c_p.ms} data-en={t.note_c_p.en} data-zh={t.note_c_p.zh}>{t.note_c_p.ms}</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="tickets-section" id="rancang" aria-labelledby="tajuk-rancang">
      <div class="section-wrap">
        <div class="section-marker light">
          <span>02</span><i></i>
          <span data-i18n="marker_02_label" data-ms={t.marker_02_label.ms} data-en={t.marker_02_label.en} data-zh={t.marker_02_label.zh}>{t.marker_02_label.ms}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tickets-layout">
          <div class="tickets-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow light"><span></span> <span data-i18n="eyebrow_02" data-ms={t.eyebrow_02.ms} data-en={t.eyebrow_02.en} data-zh={t.eyebrow_02.zh}>{t.eyebrow_02.ms}</span></p>
            <h2 id="tajuk-rancang">
              <span data-i18n="h2_02_a" data-ms={t.h2_02_a.ms} data-en={t.h2_02_a.en} data-zh={t.h2_02_a.zh}>{t.h2_02_a.ms}</span><em data-i18n="h2_02_b" data-ms={t.h2_02_b.ms} data-en={t.h2_02_b.en} data-zh={t.h2_02_b.zh}>{t.h2_02_b.ms}</em>
            </h2>
            <p data-i18n="p_02" data-ms={t.p_02.ms} data-en={t.p_02.en} data-zh={t.p_02.zh}>{t.p_02.ms}</p>
            <a class="button button-paper" href={callUrl}><span data-i18n="call_button" data-ms={t.call_button.ms} data-en={t.call_button.en} data-zh={t.call_button.zh}>{t.call_button.ms}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="ticket-list" data-i18n="tickets_aria_label" data-ms={t.tickets_aria.ms} data-en={t.tickets_aria.en} data-zh={t.tickets_aria.zh} aria-label={t.tickets_aria.ms}>
